# The Vercel CLI uploads the project directory, not the build output, and it
# does not honour .gitignore for this. Without this file the deploy tries to
# push data/ (350 MB of raw USGS ComCat and Slab2 source) and fails on the
# 100 MB limit, even though dist/ is 4.6 MB.
#
# NOTE: the pattern is root-anchored (/data/). A bare data/ matches ANY
# directory of that name at any depth, which excluded the BUILT dist/data/
# too and shipped a site whose globe 404d on manifest.json.
#
# The raw sources stay reproducible from scripts/fetch.sh plus the recorded
# sha256 in data/audit.json; they are inputs to the build, never served.
/data/
node_modules/
docs/
.git/
*.zip
*.grd
